OL,3,GNEWSADog wedding chauffeurs and doggy
OL,4,Aroasts: The rise of the puppy
OL,5,Aexperience economy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey are known as our best friends or
OL,8,Fas being part of the family, so it is
OL,9,Fonly natural that owners want to shower
OL,10,Ftheir dogs in treats and take them
OL,11,Fwherever they go.
OL,13,FBut over the past decade, this special
OL,14,Frelationship has evolved into a booming
OL,15,Findustry, fuelled by the rise of the
OL,16,Fso-called "doggy experience economy".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
