OL,3,GNEWSADog wedding chauffeurs and doggy
OL,4,Aroasts: The rise of the puppy
OL,5,Aexperience economy
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom pubs and restaurants serving up
OL,8,Fdoggy roasts to cafes offering
OL,9,FPuppuccinos and dog-friendly ice cream,
OL,10,Fcatering for our four-legged friends
OL,11,Fhas become a multi-billion-pound
OL,12,Findustry.
OL,14,FAccording to MoneySuperMarket, spending
OL,15,Fon pets and pet-related goods has
OL,16,Fsurged from #2.9bn in 1997 to #11.95bn
OL,17,Fin 2025.
